    <bpmn:process id="W_W4812" name="W4812. Accessibility (PWD/Senior) Compliance &amp; Inclusive Locker Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Site launch (W4816); accessibility audit (VS-76/VS-21); assistance need
Frequency: Continuous + periodic audit
Volume: ~1,000–2,000 PWD/senior locker customers/month across the network
Owner: Locker Program Manager / Compliance (VS-22) / Store Ops (VS-07)
Participants: Compliance (VS-22), Store Ops (VS-07), CX (VS-13), Facilities (VS-138)
Source: workflow W4812 — Accessibility (PWD/Senior) Compliance &amp; Inclusive Locker Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4812_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4812_Lane1" name="Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4812_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4812_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4812_Lane2" name="Store Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4812_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4812_Lane3" name="CX">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4812_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4812_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4812_Start5" name="Site launch (W4816); accessibility audit (VS-76/VS-21); assistance need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4812_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4812_Task6" name="Maintain PWD/senior-accessible locker compartments and placement: lower…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain PWD/senior-accessible locker compartments and placement: lower compartments at reachable height (RA 7277/BP 344), accessible screen/reader/QR placement, clear wayfinding/signage, and accessible path to the bank (no steps, ≥1.2 m clearance per VS-76 pattern); audit periodically
Responsible (R): Facilities / Compliance / LP
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager / Compliance
Duration: Continuous + periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4812_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4812_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4812_Task7" name="Provide customer assistance: store-team help for PWD/senior/less-tech-savvy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Provide customer assistance: store-team help for PWD/senior/less-tech-savvy customers (start pickup, retrieve from a high compartment, carry a bulky item), an on-site help button (W4805), and priority service for mandatory-discount-eligible segments (VS-85); brief per OCM (W4816)
Responsible (R): Store Ops / CX
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4812_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4812_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4812_Task8" name="Manage the accessibility CX and feedback: capture accessibility feedback/NPS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage the accessibility CX and feedback: capture accessibility feedback/NPS (VS-13), remediate barriers (VS-133), and ensure mandatory-discount/treatment-compliant service for eligible customers (VS-85) at the locker channel
Responsible (R): CX / Store Ops / Compliance
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager / CX
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4812_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4812_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4812_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4812_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4812_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-95 (ensure locker network custody &amp; uptime.) | - CTL-724: PWD-accessible compartments/placement per RA 7277/BP 344; assistance available; eligible customers treated per VS-85; audited periodically
Owner: Locker Program Manager / Compliance (VS-22) / Store Ops (VS-07)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
