    <bpmn:process id="W_W4815" name="W4815. Network Analytics, Utilization &amp; Footfall-to-Basket Measurement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly review; annual strategy/capex (W4793/W4800); CX program (VS-13)
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly + annual
Volume: 1 group analytics view
Owner: Locker Program Manager / Analytics (VS-28)
Participants: Ecommerce (VS-10), Finance (VS-17.4), Marketing (VS-14), CX (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4815 — Network Analytics, Utilization &amp; Footfall-to-Basket Measurement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4815_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4815_Lane1" name="Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4815_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4815_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4815_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4815_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4815_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4815_Start3" name="Monthly/quarterly review; annual strategy/capex (W4793/W4800); CX program (VS-13)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4815_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4815_Task4" name="Track network performance: banks live, availability/uptime (W4814), utilization…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Track network performance: banks live, availability/uptime (W4814), utilization (pickups/compartment/day, returns via locker, 3P parcels), session-success, abandonment rate (W4804), pickup-success/time-to-pickup (W4805), exception rate (W4808), and cost per pickup; benchmark across sites
Responsible (R): Analytics / Ecommerce / Locker Program
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4815_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4815_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4815_Task5" name="Track the footfall/basket impact: incremental store visits from locker pickups…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Track the footfall/basket impact: incremental store visits from locker pickups, basket attach during pickup, conversion of pickup-visits to purchases, returns-channel shift (counter → locker cost saving), and 3P revenue; attribute basket uplift via POS × locker-pickup data (links VS-28/VS-118)
Responsible (R): Analytics / Marketing / Finance
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager / GM, Digital Commerce Inc.
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4815_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4815_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4815_Task6" name="Report to leadership quarterly and feed the annual strategy/capex case…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Report to leadership quarterly and feed the annual strategy/capex case (W4793/W4800): reallocate capex from under- to over-performing sites, adjust own/partner and in-store/off-site mix, drive improvement (VS-133), and report CX/NPS impact (VS-13)
Responsible (R): Analytics / Locker Program / Strategy
Accountable (A): GM, Digital Commerce Inc. / COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4815_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4815_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4815_End7" name="Complete">
